    "short_description": "Horticular is a relaxing garden builder where you grow plants, design habitats and attract a wide range of wildlife. Help the gnome Keepers restore a barren wasteland with magical powers and populate it with adorable critters. Reclaim nature from a looming corruption and create your perfect garden.",
    "supported_languages": "English, German, Japanese, Swedish, Korean, Simplified Chinese, French",
